      "en": "The third day, there was a wedding in Cana of Galilee. Jesus’ mother was there.",
      "ko": "사흘 되던 날에 갈릴리 가나에 혼인이 있어 예수의 어머니도 거기 계시고",
      "source_text_hash": "7911136150b8f957572a02f2035dba482f8dcef7c8698de6169b82c2e3024a08",
      "translation_text_hash": "a79aa989a1aa9683fd4a629c8107cd1f8710f93b7e83f23d351462e07eee2f3e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "사흘 되던 날에 갈릴리 가나에 혼인이 있어 예수의 어머니도 거기 계시고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "a79aa989a1aa9683fd4a629c8107cd1f8710f93b7e83f23d351462e07eee2f3e"
