      "en": "Jesus said to her, “Woman, what does that have to do with you and me? My hour has not yet come.”",
      "ko": "예수께서 가라사대 여자여 나와 무슨 상관이 있나이까 내 때가 아직 이르지 못하였나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "26951b613448986256e888a232478b1d5e602e621a1498889ca44fe76d28c1ff",
      "translation_text_hash": "9912d6d3058e99b099c6b04e3c508c9162982292b93dca3667af9041940f48b8",
