      "en": "When the ruler of the feast tasted the water now become wine, and didn’t know where it came from (but the servants who had drawn the water knew), the ruler of the feast called the bridegroom",
      "ko": "연회장은 물로 된 포도주를 맛보고 어디서 났는지 알지 못하되 물 떠온 하인들은 알더라 연회장이 신랑을 불러",
      "source_text_hash": "ab174734f50e5846bcb7709e9fc9d95d924e08df49c89a2524991e143993239d",
      "translation_text_hash": "efcafe03365daead6ab7298bb522ff8691fc1698d478964da89527e1d6f809ec",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
